      "The separate SniperDecoy WPM selector links by GUID to U_DecoyNoGlint; Affector_DecoyAntiGlint directly references that U object.",
      "M2010 iron-sight source branch selects the no-flare configuration. This narrows the source activation chain; native final stacking/visibility and distance thresholds remain unverified."
    ],
    "notEstablished": [
